      "field": "MANA_UNIFICATION_MODE",
      "default": "\"iss_primary\"",
      "arguments": [],
      "description": "Mana Unification Mode - Controls how Ars Nouveau and Iron's Spellbooks mana systems interact:   iss_primary - Iron's Spellbooks mana is the single source (DEFAULT)   ars_primary - Ars Nouveau mana is the single source   hybrid - Both systems share a unified mana pool   separate - Separate pools with dual-cost mechanics   disabled - No mana integration at all Runtime changes are applied on the server thread and synchronized to connected clients.",
